  "notes": "The startup logo now begins fading while sensor readiness settles, removing the previous stationary grace interval. The existing fade curve, maximum readiness grace and startup safety gates are preserved.\n\nAdded bounded startup timing diagnostics for the preview-to-fade boundary and the first visibly dimmed RGB565 frame. Host checks cover continuity, completion deadlines, timer wrap, saturating arithmetic and diagnostic frame sizes.\n\nBuild and on-device timing validation are reported separately; timestamp measurements do not establish optical smoothness. Existing learned flashlight settings are preserved.\n",
